      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "LEGEND:   blue = Avalonia UI thread   |   green = MonoGame game thread   |   orange = EditorBridge / thread boundary   |   purple = HWND host plumbing\nORANGE arrows = mutation path (UI -> engine).   BLUE arrows = snapshot path (engine -> UI).   GREY arrows = intra-engine flow.   DOTTED = native HWND embedding.\nSee Editor_Architecture.md for the full write-up. Extend by adding boxes/arrows for new panels, snapshot fields, or mutation methods.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LEGEND:   blue = Avalonia UI thread   |   green = MonoGame game thread   |   orange = EditorBridge / thread boundary   |   purple = HWND host plumbing\nORANGE arrows = mutation path (UI -> engine).   BLUE arrows = snapshot path (engine -> UI).   GREY arrows = intra-engine flow.   DOTTED = native HWND embedding.\nSee Editor_Architecture.md for the full write-up. Extend by adding boxes/arrows for new panels, snapshot fields, or mutation methods.",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    }
  ],
